title: Where working time went, 2026-11-10 to 15.
pid: 7c6b072c-c7d0-425a-9881-989509755213
body: |2-
  | Records                       | Minutes | Model       | Tests, with waits for them | Builds   | Graph tool | Other commands |
  |-------------------------------+---------+-------------+----------------------------+----------+------------+----------------|
  | All                           |   1,315 | 1,017 (77%) | 108 (8%)                   | 22 (2%)  | 76 (6%)    | 87 (7%)        |
  | Build missions (specialists)  |     171 | 111 (65%)   | 39 (23%)                   | 5 (3%)   | 8 (5%)     | 8 (5%)         |
  | Reading missions              |      61 | 58 (94%)    | 0                          | 0        | 2 (2%)     | 1 (2%)         |
  "Other commands" includes 40 minutes of one session testing the
  pacer, which waits on purpose.
